    "description": "<p>Requires Commander position.</p><p>You can lead a barrage against a target that has the <em>Lock On</em> condition. <strong>Mark a Stress</strong> and burn the <em>Lock On</em> to make an <strong>Action Roll</strong> against the target without gaining the normal d6 for burning the <em>Lock On</em>. On a success, choose any number of gunners or system operators on your vehicle. All chosen may <strong>mark a Spaceship Stress</strong> to make an attack against the target or use a system against the target. If this requires a roll, it is a <strong>Reaction Roll</strong>. They also gain the <em>Lock On</em> <strong>d6</strong> on both attack and damages. Damage for each weapon that hits is applied separately.</p>",
